name: sim.setObjectName
description: 
luaSynopsis: int result=sim.setObjectName(int objectHandle,string objectName)
inputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. objectHandle: handle of the object. By adding sim.handleflag_altname to the object handle, the object alternative name can be set. By adding sim.handleflag_silenterror to the object handle, errors linked to the naming can be suppressed from output.
2. objectName: name (or alternative name) of the object
outputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. -1 if operation was not successful
